    {
      "name": "create a webhook endpoint (201): answers url null, as the sandbox does",
      "priority": 10,
      "scenarioName": "notchpay-webhooks",
      "newScenarioState": "Registered",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "urlPath": "/webhooks",
        "headers": {
          "X-Grant": {
            "matches": ".+"
          },
          "Authorization": {
            "matches": ".+"
          }
        },
        "bodyPatterns": [
          {
            "matchesJsonPath": {
              "expression": "$.url",
              "matches": "^https?://.+/provider/notchpay/callback$"
            }
          },
          {
            "matchesJsonPath": {
              "expression": "$.description",
              "matches": "^vpay:[^: ]+:notchpay:default url:[0-9a-f]{16}$"
            }
          },
          {
            "equalToJson": "{\"events\":[\"payment.created\",\"payment.complete\",\"payment.failed\",\"payment.canceled\",\"payment.expired\"]}",
            "ignoreExtraElements": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 201,
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json"
        },
        "body": "{\"code\":201,\"status\":\"Created\",\"message\":\"Webhook endpoint created successfully\",\"endpoint\":{\"id\":\"ep_test.vpaySuite0000001\",\"description\":\"{{jsonPath request.body '$.description'}}\",\"events\":[\"payment.created\",\"payment.complete\",\"payment.failed\",\"payment.canceled\",\"payment.expired\"],\"url\":null,\"status\":null,\"sandbox\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T03:54:34.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-21T03:54:34.000000Z\"}}"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "why": [
          "Transcribed from the sandbox's create answer on 2026-10-21: 201, the endpoint under `endpoint`, the",
          "description and events echoed, `url` null although the request sent one, `status` null until the list",
          "says active, and no signing secret. The body patterns are RFC-0013 section 5's Notch Pay row as this",
          "stub's contract: vpay's callback path, a description that is a marker and a URL tag, and the five",
          "PAYMENT_EVENTS. No requiredScenarioState, because Notch Pay accepts a second create at the same URL",
          "(2026-10-21, item 14): a pass that creates twice is answered twice, and the suite counts POSTs in the",
          "journal to catch it."
        ]
      }
    },
